menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_BLUETOOTH_AUDIO
    bool "Enable Bluetooth audio speaker and pairing policy"
    default n
    help
        Runs the bounded Bluetooth audio policy and adapter state machine:
        opt-in speaker mode, guardian-gated pairing, an auto-reconnect flag, a
        preferred codec, a volume ceiling and a bounded adapter/disconnect
        state. A firmware profile without a Bluetooth radio simply does not
        link the component.

endmenu
